# Competitive Analysis Report

## 1. Pricing Comparison & Positioning

| Product | Price | Price Position | Value Ratio |
|---------|-------|---|---|
| CompetitorC | $29/mo | Budget Leader | Low |
| CompetitorA | $49/mo | Economy | Medium |
| **Our Solution** | **$79/mo** | **Mid-Premium** | **High** |
| CompetitorB | $99/mo | Premium | Very High |

**Assessment:** Your pricing sits strategically between economy and premium—justified if feature claims hold up.

---

## 2. Feature Gap Analysis

### Strengths (vs. Competitors)
✅ **vs. CompetitorA & C:**
- 5x-10x more contacts (5000 vs 500-1000)
- AI automation (they lack this)
- Advanced analytics (vs. basic/none)

✅ **vs. CompetitorB:**
- $20/mo cheaper (-20%)
- Same core features (CRM, automation, analytics)

### Weaknesses
❌ **vs. CompetitorB:**
- Limited contacts (5000 vs unlimited)
- Unclear if automation is equally "advanced"

❌ **vs. All:**
- No email marketing explicitly mentioned (CompetitorA has it)
- No mention of integrations, API, or third-party tools

